        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/ca8b2cb389bddef8ecd5db5a7da9f881.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic platformer with hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white visual style. An adventure on the Moon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character flew to the moon to find a bride. The locals greeted him with disbelief. The hero will have to pass the tests and show his courage. Only then will everyone love him. It's not going to be an easy adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a philosophical story about love and choice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About gameplay...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jumps are waiting for you! It can be difficult, but it's fun. It's better to think before jumping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump! Jump! Jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/ff044e2394a11a81b117cbacb7aada08.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting challenges and lots of monsters are waiting for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are very big bosses in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You determine the fate of the hero yourself. You just need to make a choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/410e472418536a22798d68de124588ab.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What about the saves?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's simple! There are no automatic saves in the game, but there are convenient codes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are hidden in the game. As soon as the game starts, go to the left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/72bdeed7f2c4e68723d00ffba3c10306.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And at the end...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pleasant and moderately challenging platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a great way to while away an evening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of classic platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you very much!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/ca8b2cb389bddef8ecd5db5a7da9f881.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic platformer with hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white visual style. An adventure on the Moon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character flew to the moon to find a bride. The locals greeted him with disbelief. The hero will have to pass the tests and show his courage. Only then will everyone love him. It's not going to be an easy adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a philosophical story about love and choice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About gameplay...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jumps are waiting for you! It can be difficult, but it's fun. It's better to think before jumping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump! Jump! Jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/ff044e2394a11a81b117cbacb7aada08.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting challenges and lots of monsters are waiting for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are very big bosses in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You determine the fate of the hero yourself. You just need to make a choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/410e472418536a22798d68de124588ab.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What about the saves?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's simple! There are no automatic saves in the game, but there are convenient codes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are hidden in the game. As soon as the game starts, go to the left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/extras/72bdeed7f2c4e68723d00ffba3c10306.avif?t=1763500784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And at the end...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pleasant and moderately challenging platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a great way to while away an evening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of classic platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you very much!</strong></p>",
